#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/29_fresh_oak/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I'll stay in Bakar and look at the Baron's boats a little more."
msgstr "Je reste à Bakar pour regarder encore un peu les bateaux du baron."

