msgstr "Maître Ivan a lu le bois du faux bateau."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/29_fresh_oak/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "It is fresh oak from the forest of Baron Isengrim."
