"Le Seigneur nous a donné la bora, et {crew|le capitaine|la capitaine|les capitaines} pour y "
"naviguer."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/34_through_the_bura/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Let's go!"
msgstr "Allons-y !"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/34_through_the_bura/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I have counted the Baron's planks. Every one is fresh oak!"
msgstr "J'ai compté les planches du baron. Toutes sont en chêne frais !"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/34_through_the_bura/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the meeting in Rijeka is soon!"
